     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "讨论「条件与目的」时，要区分事实、推论和个人立场。",
       "alumno": "When discussing «conditions and purpose», you must distinguish facts, inferences and personal positions.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "说明证据的来源并回应反例，结论才更有说服力。",
       "alumno": "Explaining where the evidence comes from and responding to counterexamples strengthens the conclusion.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "先把问题说清楚，再举一个例子，最后说明自己的想法。",
       "alumno": "First state the problem, then give an example, and finish by explaining your opinion.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
